{"3413150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Makai Agito", "steam_appid": 3413150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413150/extras/538caf1f94e9ef0ed6a16b8595e25e11.avif?t=1746253033\" width=300 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A witch's curse descends upon the town of Mokumatsu every 13 years. Two journalists join the denizens to fight the Arcane—entities resembling supernatural beings from various folklore and mythologies. The party's goal is to end the &quot;Witching Hour&quot; once and for all.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413150/extras/4f3f63539a4c2e6ac0a639f68ab57ba6.avif?t=1746253033\" width=300 height=70 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based Combat with Front and Back Rows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit Dozens of Monsters to Summon through Offering Money and Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse Monsters and Combine their Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Monsters to Characters to gain Elemental Affinities, Skills, and Stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Dungeon Exploration <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413150/extras/b32ec8bb7fd9f4bc486a4b9d55c00e60.avif?t=1746253033\" width=228 height=142 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413150/extras/be7f0e25316641f1f85477d35e01aea7.avif?t=1746253033\" width=228 height=142 /></span><br>***We believe in video game as an art form. Our studio values and supports only works that exhibit the h